[2026-05-06] zebrav2/brain/retina.py
  FIX: Replace adaptive_avg_pool1d with F.interpolate for MPS compatibility
  - Root cause: 400→1000 RGC mapping is upsampling, not downsampling; MPS rejects
    adaptive_avg_pool1d with non-divisible input/output sizes (400÷1000 = 0.4)
  - Fix: F.interpolate(mode='linear', align_corners=False) for ON and OFF pathways
  - CPU fallback removed (was ~45-103 min/round); MPS-native upsampling restores ~3 min/round
